	(text "【24V 输入与防护】\nJ1(24V) → F1 2A 保险丝 → D22 SMBJ30CA 抑制浪涌 → D24 SS54 肖特基防反接 → +24V 母线\n反接时 D24 截止，后级不受损；C7/C8 为母线储能与高频旁路\n保险丝：4×333 mA = 1.33 A ⇒ 2A；TVS：SMBJ30CA 关断 30 V > 24×1.1 = 26.4 V，峰值钳位 48.4 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 51.054 53.848 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06b31b51-14d6-47ca-b8c4-2872afb43c0b")
	)
	(text "【LM317 计算】\nVOUT = 1.25V × (1 + R7/R6) = 1.25 × (1 + 390/240) = 3.28 V\n压差 24−3.3 = 20.7 V，负载 ≈ 9.1 mA → P = 20.7 × 9.1m = 0.19 W（TO-252 免散热片）\nR8 = 470Ω 预负载（7 mA），保证 LM317 轻载稳压；C9 输处、C10/C11 输出"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 52.07 156.718 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "274590ba-8202-4ded-acbb-f33f8f743277")
	)
